false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_09T11_24_58_420Z.png","image_width":350,"subtitle":"","title":"Finished edges","text":"<p>Complete your floor’s look with optional finished edges. The edges <em>“snap”<\/em> into place using the same interlocking system as the dance flooring tiles and provide a clean, beveled border around your dance floor.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_09T11_26_54_262Z.png","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"WHEELED CART STORAGE","text":"<p>Pair large text with an image to tell a story, explain a detail about your product, or describe a new promotion.Specially designed cart for safe and convenient storage of your portable floor, minimal space required! A perfect tool to store and transport the 21′ X 21′ dance floors <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Simple Installation"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>In four simple and fast steps, you can have your surface fully installed in minutes or less.<\/p><p><strong>Getting Started<\/strong><\/p><p>The panels have two sides with female PowerLocks, and two sides with male PowerLocks. All tiles on any given installation should always have the female PowerLocks going in the same direction.<\/p><p><strong>Step One<\/strong><\/p><p>Begin the installation by laying down your first panel in any one corner and pointing the female PowerLocks in the two directions that additional panels are to be added.<\/p><p><strong>Step Two<\/strong><\/p><p>Place the next panel so that the male PowerLock line up over the top of the female loops on the first panel. It's important to make sure that the female PowerLocks are facing exactly the same direction as the first panel.<\/p><p><strong>Step Three<\/strong><\/p><p>Gently step along the joint of the two panels. You will hear and feel the PowerLocks snap into place as you go.<\/p><p><strong>Step Four<\/strong><\/p><p>Once the two panels are joined, repeat steps one through three remembering to keep the female PowerLocks aligned until your floor is complete. That's all there is to this easy-to-install flooring!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","settings":{"title":"BUILD THE GARAGE\nOF YOUR DREAMS","title_size":60,"subheading":"GET TILES & FLOORS THAT STAND OUT","link_text":"SHOP ALL OPTIONS","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/Sequence_02_225d1be4-b1fa-430e-be00-23ad16025f9e.mp4?v=1590015552","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"1148b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.95); font-weight: bold; font-size: 23px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/HDDTSG0316-4_e1dcd94b-16f2-4528-82d5-6eaa4a0becca.gif","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Edge-to-edge seamless look","title":"Roll out Garage Mats","text":"<p>Our roll out garage mats are easily installed. Simply roll it out and trim to size if needed. Roll out garage mats will provide years of protection and look good doing it.<\/p>","button_label":"get your mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/roll-out-garage-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/FFblak-royb-ally-2-1600x1281_37980521-3a34-47b2-b0f7-9ad8c9b2beba.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Configure your tiles the way you want","title":"garage tiles","text":"<p>Transform your garage in hours, not days with these patented garage tile system. No tools for installation, no mess or toxic fumes associated with coatings and epoxies.<\/p>","button_label":"get your tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/garage-floor-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/peelgtd_l_1_3049a0d1-0079-4188-bdd8-552eec81cd7b.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"peel & stick garage tiles","title":"Solid polyvinyl Tiles","text":"<p>A simple and easy method for protecting your garage floors while making it look great. As the name goes, simply peel and stick the tiles down.<\/p>","button_label":"Get Peel & Stick Tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/peel-and-stick-garage-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/seam_tape_install_4a99ed7a-7ccf-4864-90c8-8b30e131b9fa.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"the finishing touches","title":"garage flooring details","text":"<p>Finish off your project with sealing tape, tile edges, or a top coat. We have all the accessories to cover all the finishing details. <\/p>","button_label":"get accessories","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/garage-floor-accessories","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Floor Defender Garage Continment Mats ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f220664d-cc7b-4aea-a660-b60af2d6dd5